Futu OpenAPI Protocol

This SDK implements a client for the Futu OpenD protocol. The protobuf
definitions under `api/proto/` are derived from Futu's publicly published
OpenAPI protocol definitions, and the Go bindings under `pkg/pb/` are
generated from them. The SDK does not contain any proprietary source code
from Futu Holdings Limited.

Futu OpenAPI documentation is Copyright (c) Futu Holdings Limited.
Official documentation: https://openapi.futunn.com/

